        "observed": "Inspected full-height front: twin towers stand behind projecting lower entrance block, roof balcony with open black metal railing and a central upper glazed doorway. Lower entrance has paired white columns, broad layered cornice, large arched central glazed window and two flanking rectangular panes; central recessed rounded wood/dark doorway under triangular surround. Circular/oval flank fields, short steps and external fence. Adjacent buildings obscure side elevations. Fine iron scrollwork, statue detail, text and full plaza/fence are excluded or simplified; hidden rear/side roofs follow mapped massing with explicit approximation."
